# Per-channel wire digests for test_trace_np2 (DEFAULT SHA build, test-mode build:
# emp-tool and emp-ot configured with -DEMP_TEST_MODE=ON, emp-ag configured against them).
# Regenerate: TRACE_PREFIX=/tmp/t ./runN 2 ./build/bin/test_trace_np2
# then compare /tmp/t.np2.p1.txt + p2 against the blocks below. A diff means the
# wire transcript changed: intended only for protocol-visible changes (update this
# file in the same commit, stating why); anything else is a regression.

